  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the reconstruction and development of industrial sectors in Ukraine by fostering digital transformation and the innovation ecosystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to support the reconstruction and development of industrial sectors in Ukraine the central objective of this project will be to advance economic competitiveness of priority industrial sectors through fostering digital transformation and innovation ecosystem.The objectives of the project are aligned with the objectives of the Digital Europe Programme and contain components based on the needs and objectives of the Ukraine#s Ministry of Strategic Industries, Ministry of Economy, and Ministry of Digital Transformation that were directly articulated to UNIDO.</narrative>
  </description>
